# python-eyetracker


Minimal MVP for unified calibration and benchmarking across WebGazer, TurkerGaze, Pupil Labs Core, and Optimeyes.


## Quickstart
```bash
uvicorn eyetrk.web_bridge.server:app --reload & # if using web trackers
eyetrack calibrate --trackers webgazer turkergaze pupilcore optimeyes --protocol 9pt
eyetrack validate --trackers all
eyetrack run-tasks --tasks fixation-grid step-saccades smooth-pursuit
eyetrack report --runs runs
```
